## Recommended next pass

1. Replace visible scene literals with translation keys or `tr(...)`-driven values.
2. Move script-generated gameplay/status text to translation keys, especially in:
   - `Games/ReelIntoDarkness/Scenes/ReelIntoDarknessMain.gd`
   - `Games/Turkey/Scenes/TurkeyMain.gd`
   - `Tech Tree Stuff/TechTreeNode.gd`
   - `Fishing/BattleScene.gd`
3. Decide whether debug-only UI should be localized or ignored for shipping builds.
4. Re-scan after those fixes, because several placeholders may hide additional runtime English assembled from code paths not covered by this static pass.
